<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Tele Danmark.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Tele Danmark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele Danmark was raised to the European &quot;recommended list&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the U.S. investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
